ewlabel{fig:dose_response}{{4}{9}{	extbf {Normalization dose-response} (frozen, 5 seeds $	imes $ 6 datasets). 	extbf {Left:} MSE vs $\alpha $ ($0{=}$raw, $1{=}$RevIN). Phase transition at $\alpha {=}1.0$ ($+283\%$), mild for $\alpha {\leq }0.75$ ($+5.4\%$). 	extbf {Right:} entropy stays high at all $\alpha $---normalization renders routing uninformative, not collapsed}{figure.4}{}}

