570	Top-2 sparse routing retains most of the dense gain at a $+10\%$ latency cost (Appendix~\ref{app:topk}); the advantage extends to imputation ($7/8$ datasets; Appendix~\ref{app:imputation}) and is stable across forecast horizons $H{\in}\{96{,}192{,}336{,}720\}$ (24/24 wins; Table~\ref{tab:horizon}). The companion \textbf{Residual-IA\textsuperscript{+}} variant (Appendix~\ref{app:gate_pathology}) extends this to all 6 datasets across 5 backbones and 4 horizons (Table~\ref{tab:residual_ia_plus_mhcb}).}
